# the five pages by controller (0.2.0-beta.5): each page's controls reachable (Check for updates keeps the focus),
# LB/RB through all five both ways, the side menu (the launcher's own rollback button needs a kept launcher:
# tests/launcher_gui_update_check.py presses it)
until 200000 PLAY
wait 30
expect PLAY
seek 6000 down Check for updates
expect Check for updates
# pressed: the focus stays on it while it checks (offline here) and after -- never back to PLAY
a
until 3000 Checking
expect Checking
wait 120
until 6000 Check for updates
expect Check for updates
# the check's result brought into view under the button that keeps the focus (at 1280x800 and below it was left
# out of view, and a card below the view is out of the D-pad's reach)
wait 20
see Offline
shot 1-play
rb
wait 60
until 20000 Choose
expect Choose
shot 2-manage
seek 20000 down Change the installation folder
expect Change the installation folder
# the shaders' row: Precompile now only while something is left to prepare (a prepared installation: Rebuild alone)
seek 20000 down shader cache
expect Rebuild shader cache
seek 20000 down Steam
expect Steam
seek 2000 right Remove from Steam
expect Remove from Steam
left
wait 20
expect Add to Steam
# the shortcuts' card may lie below the view: a press that reaches nothing scrolls the page, the next reaches it
seek 2000 down -menu shortcut
expect -menu shortcut
right
wait 20
expect Desktop shortcut
left
wait 20
down
wait 30
expect Open the artwork pages
right
wait 20
expect Choose the poster image
# back to the left column (the D-pad keeps the column it last moved to)
left
wait 20
expect Open the artwork pages
seek 20000 down Choose the hero image
expect Choose the hero image
shot 3-manage-art
seek 20000 down previous game build
expect previous game build
# Uninstall beside it (1280x720) or under it (1280x800): right reaches it beside, does nothing otherwise
right
wait 20
seek 20000 down Uninstall the game
expect Uninstall the game
seek 20000 down Remove the launcher
expect Remove the launcher
shot 4-manage-bottom
rb
wait 60
until 20000 Back up now
expect Back up now
rb
wait 60
until 20000 Import a file
expect Import a file
shot 4b-characters
rb
wait 60
until 20000 Graphics
expect Graphics
shot 5-settings
seek 20000 down Restore the defaults
expect Restore the defaults
rb
wait 60
until 20000 Export Logs
expect Export Logs
rb
wait 60
until 20000 PLAY
expect PLAY
lb
wait 60
until 20000 Export Logs
expect Export Logs
lb
wait 60
lb
wait 60
until 20000 Import a file
expect Import a file
lb
wait 60
until 20000 Back up now
expect Back up now
lb
wait 60
until 20000 Choose
expect Choose
lb
wait 60
until 20000 PLAY
expect PLAY
left
wait 30
expect menu: Play
down
wait 20
expect menu: Install / Manage
down
wait 20
expect menu: Saves
down
wait 20
expect menu: Characters
down
wait 20
expect menu: Settings
down
wait 20
expect menu: Diagnostics
down
wait 20
expect menu: Exit
quit
